                "id": "r1",
                "text": "The issue, evidence and conclusion form a coherent argument."
              },
              {
                "id": "r2",
                "text": "I treated the alternative fairly and retained a limitation on my conclusion."
              }
            ],
            "minLength": 1
          }
        ],
        "sequential": true
      }
